# Problem profile

Import WebProblem from "./web_problem.lg".
Import WebFormat from "./web_format.lg".
Import UiStage from "./ui_stage.lg".

The head of a problem's page: where it comes from and stands, its statement as
the source gives it, and the OPDP atlas's profile of it when the atlas covers it.

## Component ProblemHead (p: ProblemView)

View:
    <section class="page-head">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">{p's cohort} · {p's collection} · {p's category}</div>
        <h1 id="problem-title">{p's title}</h1>
        <div class="statement-head">
          <StageMark stage={p's stage}/>
          <span class="chip">{p's status}</span>
          <span class="chip kind">{p's id}</span>
          {if p's externalKey is not equal to "":}<span class="chip">{p's externalKey}</span>{end}
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="totals">
        <div class="total"><b id="attempts">{formatCount(p's attempts)}</b><span>attempts</span></div>
        <div class="total"><b id="attested">{formatCount(p's attested)}</b><span>attested</span></div>
        <div class="total"><b>{formatMoney(p's spentMicros)}</b><span>spent</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>

## Component ProblemProfile (p: ProblemView)

View:
    <div class="card">
      <h2>The problem</h2>
      {if p's statementInformal is not equal to "":}<p id="informal">{p's statementInformal}</p>{end}
      {if p's leanStatement is not equal to "":}
        <div class="eyebrow">Lean statement · {p's leanDeclaration}</div>
        <pre class="doc" id="lean">{p's leanStatement}</pre>
      {end}
      {if p's difficulty is not equal to "":}
        <h3>OPDP profile</h3>
        <dl class="facts" id="opdp">
          <div><dt>Difficulty</dt><dd>{p's difficultyLabel}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Intrinsic</dt><dd>{p's difficulty} · {p's tier}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>AI fit</dt><dd>{p's aiFit}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>AI difficulty</dt><dd>{p's aiDifficulty}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Tractability</dt><dd>{p's tractability}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Chance of progress</dt><dd>{p's progress}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Formalization burden</dt><dd>{p's formalization}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Verification burden</dt><dd>{p's verification}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Tool leverage</dt><dd>{p's toolLeverage}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Specialist hours</dt><dd>{p's effortHours}</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <p class="muted">{p's route}. {p's explanation}</p>
      {else:}
        <p class="muted">The OPDP atlas does not profile this problem.</p>
      {end}
    </div>
